 339:ctrl_pend.c   ****    Coeficientes pre-convertidos: qA31, qB31, etc. (= arm_float_to_q31 del valor físico)
 340:ctrl_pend.c   **** 
 341:ctrl_pend.c   ****    arm_dot_prod_q31: resultado 16.48 → >>17 para Q31
 342:ctrl_pend.c   ****    arm_scale_q31(..., shift=0): (src × scaleFract) >> 31 → Q31
 343:ctrl_pend.c   ****    arm_add_q31: suma saturada Q31
 344:ctrl_pend.c   ****    ============================================================ */
